  "ctaTitle": "An arbitral award has been issued and you need an assessment of your position?",
  "ctaBody": "We can review the award, the arbitration agreement and the procedural file to decide whether there is a statutory ground for an annulment action, or a need for a request for interpretation, correction or an additional award, with an assessment of a stay of enforcement and the path to enforcing the award.",
